			<div class="content" id="post-content-4060581">
									

<p>image source: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Toysrus_Us.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Toysrus_Us.jpg</a></p>
<p>First of all, very special thanks to Lordstonefish for creating the audio track for this, my first multi-media SCP.</p>
<p>For everyone who didn't click on each of the many crosslinks in this SCP, here's a list of all the Cameos:</p>
<p>The two Elf girls are Ellette Carling and her sister (the girl who met her when she got home) from my own SCP-3903. Ellette's an Elf now as well, having retaken her Fey name (I will write a tale about this eventually).</p>
<p>The staff member is FallenZealot from the tale <a href="/iris-dark">Iris Dark</a>. He apparently survived whatever she and Percy did to him in Osteontronic Cubes.</p>
<p>The demon is H'rasm'Kal, who works for MC&amp;D, and the Clowns are obviously Eugene and Pius from the Circus of the Disquieting.</p>
<p>The girl with the zombie-thing is Katrina, a necromancer created by ninevolt.</p>
<p>The Man in the hat is supposed to be smiling man from SCP-507.</p>
<p>Chaz is Chaz Ambrose, who owns a chain of anomalous restaurants, and the girl scouts are probably from Night Vale, which I've implied exists in my Canon before.</p>
<p>Thanks to all my beta readers: ihp, lordstonefish, IAmTheOoga, Leveritas, KindlyTurtleRock, Othello and uncle nicolini.</p>

